@baseUrl=http://localhost:8000/api/v1/webhooks
@paymentId=REPLACE_WITH_PAYMENT_ID

# No auth — this is what Thawani itself calls, configured as a callback
# URL in the Thawani merchant dashboard. The payload is never trusted
# directly (see thawani.webhook.controller.ts) — it only triggers a fresh,
# authenticated GET against Thawani for whichever payment the reference id
# points at. Useful for manually simulating a webhook call locally instead
# of exposing this server to the internet during development.

### simulate a Thawani webhook call

POST {{baseUrl}}/thawani
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "client_reference_id": "{{paymentId}}",
    "payment_status": "paid"
  }
}
